\/IMG_7323-2048x1536.jpg 2048w\" sizes=\"(max-width: 640px) 100vw, 640px\" \/>\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<\/div>\n\t\t\t\t<\/div>\n\t\t\t\t<div class=\"elementor-element elementor-element-75f36bf elementor-widget elementor-widget-text-editor\" data-id=\"75f36bf\" data-element_type=\"widget\" data-widget_type=\"text-editor.default\">\n\t\t\t\t<div class=\"elementor-widget-container\">\n\t\t\t<style>\/*! elementor - v3.19.0 - 28-02-2024 *\/\n.elementor-widget-text-editor.elementor-drop-cap-view-stacked .elementor-drop-cap{background-color:#69727d;color:#fff}.elementor-widget-text-editor.elementor-drop-cap-view-framed .elementor-drop-cap{color:#69727d;border:3px solid;background-color:transparent}.elementor-widget-text-editor:not(.elementor-drop-cap-view-default) .elementor-drop-cap{margin-top:8px}.elementor-widget-text-editor:not(.elementor-drop-cap-view-default) .elementor-drop-cap-letter{width:1em;height:1em}.elementor-widget-text-editor .elementor-drop-cap{float:left;text-align:center;line-height:1;font-size:50px}.elementor-widget-text-editor .elementor-drop-cap-letter{display:inline-block}<\/style>\t\t\t\t<header aria-label=\"Article header\"><\/header><div><p dir=\"ltr\"><strong>Vulcan Shield Global Wraps Up CAMX 2026<\/strong><\/p><p dir=\"ltr\"><strong>Atlanta, GA.<\/strong> Vulcan Shield Global (VSG) has wrapped up three days at CAMX 2026, the Composites and Advanced Materials Expo, held September 22-24 at the Georgia World Congress Center.<\/p><p dir=\"ltr\"><strong>What we brought to the show<\/strong><\/p><p dir=\"ltr\">Our team presented VSG&#8217;s alumina fiber range, from continuous fiber products like woven fabrics, tapes, braided sleeves, ropes, and sewing threads to bulk fiber and needled blankets. Our continuous fibers are built for extreme temperatures, perfect for CMCs in applications requiring high thermal insulation.<\/p><p dir=\"ltr\">Most of our conversations centered on two continuous fiber grades developed for ceramic matrix composites (CMC):<\/p><ul dir=\"ltr\"><li><strong>C-85<\/strong> is an alumina-mullite fiber with 85% alumina content and continuous use at 1300\u00b0C. Its alpha-alumina and mullite crystal phase suits CMC applications that need resistance to thermal shock and creep.<\/li><li><strong>M-99<\/strong> is a high-purity alpha-alumina fiber with 98% or higher alumina content. It has the highest single filament tensile strength (2.4 GPa) and modulus (330 GPa) in our range, which makes it a fit for oxide-oxide CMC.<\/li><\/ul><p dir=\"ltr\">It was good to see familiar faces from our existing customer base and to talk through their requirements in person. Thank you to everyone who stopped by the booth.<\/p><p dir=\"ltr\"><strong>Moving quickly<\/strong><\/p><p dir=\"ltr\">VSG started mass production of alumina continuous fiber textiles in 2023. Since then, we have completed our Shanghai plant, started production at Guangxi, and opened our Hungarian plant in April 2026. Along the way we made a significant breakthrough in our 99% alumina fiber, M-99.<\/p><p dir=\"ltr\">That is a lot of ground to cover in a few years, and we don&#8217;t plan to slow down.<\/p><p dir=\"ltr\"><strong>What keeps us going<\/strong><\/p><p dir=\"ltr\">The speed comes from the demand we see. Customers in various demanding industries like energy, consumer electronics and industrial manufacturing keep asking more of their materials: higher temperatures, lower weight, longer service life. Every time those requirements move, ours move with them. That push for better materials is what motivates us to keep innovating, whether that means new fibers, better processes, or more production capacity closer to the people who use them.<\/p><p dir=\"ltr\"><strong>Looking ahead<\/strong><\/p><p dir=\"ltr\">To talk about your application or request product information, contact us at sales@vulcanshield.com. We&#8217;ll be exhibiting in JEC 2027 in Paris, Do drop by our booth and have a chat to see how our solutions can help you with your engineering problems.<\/p><\/div>\t\t\t\t\t\t<\/div>\n\t\t\t\t<\/div>\n\t\t\t\t<\/div>\n\t\t<div class=\"elementor-element elementor-element-336a279 e-flex e-con-boxed e-con e-parent\" data-id=\"336a279\" data-element_type=\"container\" data-settings=\"{&quot;content_width&quot;:&quot;boxed&quot;}\" data-core-v316-plus=\"true\">\n\t\t\t\t\t<div class=\"e-con-inner\">\n\t\t<div class=\"elementor-element elementor-element-07042b0 e-con-full e-flex e-con e-child\" data-id=\"07042b0\" data-element_type=\"container\" data-settings=\"{&quot;content_width&quot;:&quot;full&quot;}\">\n\t\t\t\t<div class=\"elementor-element elementor-element-06042b7 elementor-widget elementor-widget-image\" data-id=\"06042b7\" data-element_type=\"widget\" data-widget_type=\"image.default\">\n\t\t\t\t<div class=\"elementor-widget-container\">\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<img decoding=\"async\" width=\"640\" height=\"853\" src=\"https:\/\/www.vulcanshield.com\/wp-content\/uploads\/2026\/10\/IMG_3384-768x1024.jpg\" class=\"attachment-large size-large wp-image-1979\" alt=\"\" srcset=\"https:\/\/www.vulcanshield.com\/wp-content\/uploads\/2026\/10\/IMG_3384-768x1024.jpg 768w, https:\/\/www.vulcanshield.com\/wp-content\/uploads\/2026\/10\/IMG_3384-225x300.jpg 225w, https:\/\/www.vulcanshield.com\/wp-content\/uploads\/2026\/10\/IMG_3384-1152x1536.jpg 1152w, https:\/\/www.vulcanshield.com\/wp-content\/uploads\/2026\/10\/IMG_3384-1536x2048.jpg 1536w, https:\/\/www.vulcanshield.com\/wp-content\/uploads\/2026\/10\/IMG_3384-scaled.jpg 1920w\" sizes=\"(max-width: 640px) 100vw, 640px\" \/>\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<\/div>\n\t\t\t\t<\/div>\n\t\t\t\t<\/div>\n\t\t<div class=\"elementor-element elementor-element-e310bf5 e-con-full e-flex e-con e-child\" data-id=\"e310bf5\" data-element_type=\"container\" data-settings=\"{&quot;content_width&quot;:&quot;full&quot;}\">\n\t\t\t\t<div class=\"elementor-element elementor-element-2e59642 elementor-widget elementor-widget-image\" data-id=\"2e59642\" data-element_t